00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:14.000
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:14,147 --> 00:00:16,159
[music: "My Bias, My Boss" theme song]

2
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:52,707
(This drama is a work of fiction)

3
00:00:52,731 --> 00:00:54,000
(Any similarity to real people,
organizations, or events is coincidental)

4
00:00:54,968 --> 00:00:56,457
[birds singing]

5
00:01:09,351 --> 00:01:10,441
(Dareum) Mr. Kang.

6
00:01:11,288 --> 00:01:12,316
(Hagi) Yes?

7
00:01:13,475 --> 00:01:14,590
(Dareum) What do you think...

8
00:01:15,283 --> 00:01:18,700
about me applying
for the Paris assignment?

9
00:01:20,157 --> 00:01:21,900
[calm music]

10
00:01:28,255 --> 00:01:29,433
[Dareum grunts]

11
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,209
I was just curious.

12
00:01:31,276 --> 00:01:33,493
I'm learning a lot here right now,

13
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:37,598
but I wonder what it'd be like
to work in a different environment.

14
00:01:39,849 --> 00:01:40,890
[faint laugh]

15
00:01:41,969 --> 00:01:43,003
That would be nice.

16
00:01:46,006 --> 00:01:46,873
Really?

17
00:01:47,342 --> 00:01:48,275
Of course.

18
00:01:48,901 --> 00:01:51,378
(Hagi) You should gain experience
in a different environment too.

19
00:01:53,347 --> 00:01:56,049
And an employee's growth
would help the company as well.

20
00:01:57,384 --> 00:01:58,385
You should apply.

21
00:02:02,289 --> 00:02:03,290
What about you?

22
00:02:04,382 --> 00:02:05,292
Me?

23
00:02:05,993 --> 00:02:06,927
Are you fine with it?

24
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:08,333
[faint laugh]

25
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,229
Of course.

26
00:02:09,955 --> 00:02:12,501
(Hagi) Paris is just
a plane ride away, you know.

27
00:02:14,001 --> 00:02:15,002
[rustles]

28
00:02:16,170 --> 00:02:17,537
[sighs]

29
00:02:20,007 --> 00:02:21,214
[music stops]

30
00:02:22,142 --> 00:02:23,110
[laughs]

31
00:02:23,477 --> 00:02:24,233
[Mimi gasps]

32
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:26,240
(Mimi) Are you kidding me?

33
00:02:26,307 --> 00:02:28,000
You barely just started dating
your first boyfriend.

34
00:02:28,067 --> 00:02:29,488
[rattles]
(Seula) So what did he say?

35
00:02:29,555 --> 00:02:31,385
(Mimi) He would've been shocked,
obviously.

36
00:02:31,852 --> 00:02:32,653
He said it's okay.

37
00:02:33,565 --> 00:02:34,554
(Mimi) What?
[Seula gasps]

38
00:02:34,621 --> 00:02:36,156
[intriguing music]

39
00:02:36,223 --> 00:02:38,081
He told me to go to Paris.

40
00:02:38,148 --> 00:02:40,160
(Seula) Maybe he didn't know how to react.

41
00:02:41,128 --> 00:02:42,329
He seemed sincere, though.

42
00:02:42,567 --> 00:02:43,733
[Mimi inhales]

43
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,879
(Mimi) Hey, I know this
because I've done it myself.

44
00:02:46,566 --> 00:02:48,335
You'll break up for sure
if you start a long-distance relationship.

45
00:02:49,469 --> 00:02:50,498
(Dareum) Why?

46
00:02:50,565 --> 00:02:51,500
Even Han Jeongyeon

47
00:02:51,567 --> 00:02:53,607
wanted to steal your boyfriend.

48
00:02:53,674 --> 00:02:55,742
(Mimi) Do you really think
women would leave him alone?

49
00:02:56,185 --> 00:02:57,010
They'll steal him away.

50
00:02:57,077 --> 00:02:58,411
[comical sound]
- (Dareum) What?
- (Seula) She's right.

51
00:02:58,478 --> 00:03:01,414
You said dozens of women
asked him out at work too.

52
00:03:01,481 --> 00:03:02,682
[cat hissing sound]
[grunts]

53
00:03:02,749 --> 00:03:03,600
(Let's steal Kang Hagi)
[inhales]
[comical sound]

54
00:03:03,667 --> 00:03:05,285
(women) Kang Hagi!
[women cheer]

55
00:03:05,352 --> 00:03:06,801
(Mimi) No way.

56
00:03:07,287 --> 00:03:09,289
You really can't do this.

57
00:03:10,057 --> 00:03:11,667
[deflated sound effect]
[music stops]

58
00:03:11,734 --> 00:03:12,726
[sizzling]

59
00:03:12,793 --> 00:03:14,313
[wooden bell sound]

60
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:15,996
[chanson music]

61
00:03:16,663 --> 00:03:18,878
[ding sound]

62
00:03:19,833 --> 00:03:21,335
[kissing sound]

63
00:03:22,927 --> 00:03:24,371
[Dareum exclaims]
[taps]

64
00:03:24,438 --> 00:03:25,706
[baby laughing sound]

65
00:03:25,998 --> 00:03:27,540
[Dareum laughs]

66
00:03:27,607 --> 00:03:29,442
[sparkling sound]
(man) [in French] I love you, Dareum.

67
00:03:29,509 --> 00:03:31,267
[swish sound]
(Dareum) I love you too.

68
00:03:31,334 --> 00:03:32,679
[laughs]

69
00:03:32,746 --> 00:03:35,048
[cute sound effects]
[blinking sound]

70
00:03:35,549 --> 00:03:36,754
[bubble popping sound]
[sizzling]

71
00:03:36,821 --> 00:03:38,485
[melting sound effect]

72
00:03:38,552 --> 00:03:40,253
- (Minwoo) [in Korean] Hey!
- (Hagi) Oh, my gosh!
[music stops]

73
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,421
What's taking so long?

74
00:03:41,855 --> 00:03:43,114
(Minwoo) I'm starving!

75
00:03:43,181 --> 00:03:45,325
You've been cooking those dumplings
for ages!

76
00:03:45,592 --> 00:03:46,760
Jeez, you scare me...

77
00:03:47,494 --> 00:03:48,901
[intriguing music]

78
00:03:48,968 --> 00:03:49,934
[clatters]

79
00:03:52,811 --> 00:03:53,801
[thuds]

80
00:03:54,701 --> 00:03:55,901
[can opening]

81
00:03:55,968 --> 00:03:57,689
(Minwoo) Yes!

82
00:03:59,372 --> 00:04:01,909
Wow. You burned it all.

83
00:04:02,809 --> 00:04:06,546
This is all because you told her to go
to Paris when you didn't even mean it.

84
00:04:07,447 --> 00:04:10,450
Oh, that's hot...
[comical sound]

85
00:04:10,517 --> 00:04:11,718
[Hagi grunts]

86
00:04:12,819 --> 00:04:13,853
Listen.

87
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,955
Dating is like a dumpling.
[comical sound]

88
00:04:16,022 --> 00:04:17,491
You have to flip it when it's hot,
[whoosh sound]

89
00:04:17,558 --> 00:04:19,226
then put it down to let it cool.
[swish sound]

90
00:04:19,593 --> 00:04:21,667
You need a bit of distance
[comical sound]

91
00:04:21,734 --> 00:04:22,696
to make it last longer.

92
00:04:23,156 --> 00:04:25,398
Take a step back
to take two steps forward.

93
00:04:25,465 --> 00:04:27,567
That's what dating experts do.

94
00:04:27,949 --> 00:04:29,868
[comical sound]

95
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,771
[bubble popping sound]
[baby crying sound]

96
00:04:31,838 --> 00:04:32,639
[popping sound]

97
00:04:32,706 --> 00:04:34,441
Why does it have to be France?
[music stops]

98
00:04:35,397 --> 00:04:38,200
They'll kiss her on the cheeks
whenever they say hi.

99
00:04:39,334 --> 00:04:40,413
I don't like it.

100
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,481
Are you worried already?

101
00:04:42,883 --> 00:04:45,000
- No, I'm not.
- (Minwoo) You are!

102
00:04:45,067 --> 00:04:47,020
Hey, just be chill and let her go.

103
00:04:47,087 --> 00:04:48,667
Don't be such a loser.
[whoosh sound]

104
00:04:48,734 --> 00:04:50,673
[playful music]
It'll be over if you go.

105
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:52,225
(Mimi) You'll break up for sure.
[whoosh sound]

106
00:04:52,292 --> 00:04:53,660
You have to let her go
for your relationship to last!

107
00:04:53,727 --> 00:04:55,328
(Minwoo) Just be cool and let her go!

108
00:04:55,395 --> 00:04:56,898
[whoosh sound]
Never.

109
00:04:56,965 --> 00:04:57,864
No!
[buzzer beeping sound]

110
00:04:57,931 --> 00:04:59,332
[swish sounds]
(Minwoo) Go!

111
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,267
(Mimi) No!
[buzzer beeping sound]

112
00:05:00,334 --> 00:05:01,234
(Minwoo) Go!

113
00:05:01,301 --> 00:05:02,302
(Mimi) No!
[buzzer beeping sound]

114
00:05:03,368 --> 00:05:04,437
[music stops]

115
00:05:04,671 --> 00:05:05,539
[Dareum groans]

116
00:05:05,606 --> 00:05:07,207
(Final Episode)
[birds singing]
[wind blowing]

117
00:05:08,103 --> 00:05:09,342
[biting sound]

118
00:05:09,409 --> 00:05:10,911
[intriguing music]

119
00:05:14,114 --> 00:05:15,357
[knocking]

120
00:05:16,517 --> 00:05:17,784
[clatters]
[music stops]
(Hagi) Yes?

121
00:05:17,851 --> 00:05:18,919
[door opens]

122
00:05:19,586 --> 00:05:20,587
(Miyeong) Mr. Kang.

123
00:05:21,534 --> 00:05:23,757
[door closes]
Did you see the notice from HAN?

124
00:05:24,257 --> 00:05:25,745
[mouse clicking]
Oh, not yet.

125
00:05:25,812 --> 00:05:28,259
(Miyeong) It's a request
for a seconded employee.

126
00:05:28,326 --> 00:05:30,830
"We strongly hope that Ms. Nam Dareum

127
00:05:30,897 --> 00:05:32,999
[intriguing music]
will be seconded to us."

128
00:05:33,066 --> 00:05:34,401
That's what it says.

129
00:05:40,178 --> 00:05:41,341
[wooden bell sound]

130
00:05:41,408 --> 00:05:43,243
[whoosh sound]
[sparkling sound]

131
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:45,641
We haven't confirmed
whether Ms. Nam is willing yet.

132
00:05:46,443 --> 00:05:47,480
Then ask her.

133
00:05:48,081 --> 00:05:49,158
(Miyeong) Pardon?

134
00:05:49,683 --> 00:05:52,318
Let's reply that we'll give the request
favorable consideration

135
00:05:52,385 --> 00:05:53,820
if Ms. Nam is willing.

136
00:05:55,726 --> 00:05:57,524
"Favorable consideration"?

137
00:05:57,591 --> 00:05:59,392
(Hagi) Yes. That would be nice.

138
00:05:59,993 --> 00:06:01,327
The growth of an employee
[ding sound]

139
00:06:01,394 --> 00:06:02,601
leads to the growth of our company.
[whoosh sound]

140
00:06:02,668 --> 00:06:04,458
[claps]
[fanfare sound]
Growth for everyone.

141
00:06:04,525 --> 00:06:05,398
[popping sound]
[cheering sound]

142
00:06:05,465 --> 00:06:06,533
[laughs]

143
00:06:06,867 --> 00:06:08,443
[laughs awkwardly]
[Hagi claps]

144
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:10,570
Mr. Kang...

145
00:06:11,137 --> 00:06:12,806
Are you really okay with that?

146
00:06:12,873 --> 00:06:13,998
Of course.

147
00:06:14,065 --> 00:06:15,509
[baby crying sound]
[dripping sound]

148
00:06:15,576 --> 00:06:16,881
[laughs awkwardly]

149
00:06:17,377 --> 00:06:18,868
All right, then...

150
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,249
[music stops]

151
00:06:25,929 --> 00:06:26,853
[laughs]

152
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,534
[Hagi grunts]
[Miyeong laughs awkwardly]

153
00:06:31,033 --> 00:06:32,492
[intriguing music]
[door closes]

154
00:06:37,654 --> 00:06:38,600
[sighs]

155
00:06:38,667 --> 00:06:40,047
[phone vibrating]

156
00:06:42,287 --> 00:06:43,462
[music stops]

157
00:06:44,471 --> 00:06:47,474
[message notification sound]
(Minwoo) Hey. I just saw Choi Sungwook.
Here's the address.

158
00:06:50,374 --> 00:06:51,606
[faint sigh]

159
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,547
(Car Wash)
[splashing]

160
00:06:55,415 --> 00:06:57,288
(owner) You'll never finish at this rate.

161
00:06:57,355 --> 00:06:58,567
Hurry up, everyone!

162
00:06:58,991 --> 00:07:00,256
Did you wipe over here?

163
00:07:00,323 --> 00:07:02,934
You didn't wipe the wheel here.
Get this part too.

164
00:07:04,658 --> 00:07:06,693
- Mr. Choi. Don't just wipe there.
- (Sungwook) Yes?

165
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:08,029
(owner) Wipe the top too.

166
00:07:08,096 --> 00:07:09,493
Yes, sir.

167
00:07:10,664 --> 00:07:13,217
(owner) Don't be so gentle. Wipe harder.

168
00:07:13,284 --> 00:07:14,834
(Sungwook) Yes, sir.

169
00:07:18,513 --> 00:07:20,331
[calm music]

170
00:07:26,224 --> 00:07:27,234
(owner) Jeez...

171
00:07:36,589 --> 00:07:38,252
[birds singing]
[street sounds]

172
00:07:39,588 --> 00:07:40,783
[music stops]

173
00:07:45,942 --> 00:07:47,479
[wind blowing]

174
00:07:49,545 --> 00:07:50,534
(Hagi) Did you quit just to do this?

175
00:07:50,937 --> 00:07:52,739
Why did you do it
when you couldn't even make it big?

176
00:07:53,505 --> 00:07:54,507
Well...

177
00:07:55,375 --> 00:07:56,610
Yeah, I guess you're right.

178
00:08:02,816 --> 00:08:03,917
(Hagi) Why didn't you send them

179
00:08:04,551 --> 00:08:05,619
the final version?

180
00:08:09,061 --> 00:08:09,990
[smacks lips]

181
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:12,158
Because I'm an idiot.
[scoffs]

182
00:08:19,785 --> 00:08:20,934
I couldn't bear

183
00:08:21,663 --> 00:08:23,003
to see you actually get screwed.

184
00:08:24,825 --> 00:08:26,172
[calm music]

185
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:28,875
(Sungwook) Do you remember...

186
00:08:29,843 --> 00:08:33,614
when we first got our office for APPELLO?

187
00:08:34,581 --> 00:08:36,750
We moved boxes all night,

188
00:08:37,712 --> 00:08:38,985
and when the servers crashed,

189
00:08:39,052 --> 00:08:41,087
we'd practically live
at the office for days.

190
00:08:42,723 --> 00:08:43,957
How could I...

191
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:46,593
forget about all that?

192
00:08:51,011 --> 00:08:53,833
What I did gave me some breathing room...

193
00:08:55,535 --> 00:08:57,437
but it only made me feel worse afterward.

194
00:08:58,570 --> 00:08:59,739
I thought, "What am I even doing?"

195
00:09:03,419 --> 00:09:04,734
But I guess this is for the best.

196
00:09:08,389 --> 00:09:09,549
Do you think anyone
would admire you for that?

197
00:09:11,118 --> 00:09:13,053
You should've just screwed me over
properly and made a killing!

198
00:09:14,521 --> 00:09:15,688
(Hagi) I still...

199
00:09:19,255 --> 00:09:20,660
hate you so much for it.

200
00:09:24,631 --> 00:09:26,533
That's only right.

201
00:09:33,906 --> 00:09:34,901
(Sungwook) Hagi.

202
00:09:37,371 --> 00:09:38,445
It wasn't your fault...

203
00:09:39,646 --> 00:09:40,713
that I ended up like this.

204
00:09:41,281 --> 00:09:42,482
And it's not because you succeeded.

205
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,351
It's just...

206
00:09:47,121 --> 00:09:48,488
[sighs]

207
00:09:49,322 --> 00:09:50,256
I...

208
00:09:51,091 --> 00:09:52,592
couldn't even cheer you on.

209
00:09:54,586 --> 00:09:57,297
I hated myself for having
such petty feelings.

210
00:10:00,767 --> 00:10:02,202
And I couldn't bear it.

211
00:10:09,343 --> 00:10:11,300
I really am sorry.

212
00:10:15,384 --> 00:10:16,549
And thank you...

213
00:10:17,518 --> 00:10:20,887
for at least giving me
a chance to explain.

214
00:10:24,850 --> 00:10:27,527
(owner) Mr. Choi!
Don't you see we're busy here?

215
00:10:28,113 --> 00:10:29,295
(Sungwook) Coming, sir!

216
00:10:37,725 --> 00:10:38,805
Hagi.

217
00:10:41,174 --> 00:10:42,543
I still feel...

218
00:10:43,865 --> 00:10:45,678
grateful to you.

219
00:10:49,415 --> 00:10:50,149
Bye.

220
00:10:54,534 --> 00:10:56,122
[footsteps fading]

221
00:11:01,966 --> 00:11:02,996
[sniffles]

222
00:11:09,868 --> 00:11:11,332
[music stops]

223
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,800
(Overseas Assignment Application)

224
00:11:19,824 --> 00:11:21,224
(HAN Headquarters, Paris)

225
00:11:23,687 --> 00:11:25,050
[sighs]

226
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:28,488
(Miyeong) I thought you'd like the idea.

227
00:11:30,579 --> 00:11:31,491
[laughs awkwardly]

228
00:11:31,892 --> 00:11:32,959
What is it?

229
00:11:33,026 --> 00:11:34,094
Is it because of Mr. Kang?

230
00:11:35,340 --> 00:11:36,901
[calm music]

231
00:11:39,333 --> 00:11:40,266
[faint sigh]

232
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,701
He's already having a hard time
because of Mr. Choi.

233
00:11:45,423 --> 00:11:47,207
I feel like I'd just make it worse.

234
00:11:48,041 --> 00:11:49,054
[Miyeong reacts]

235
00:11:49,442 --> 00:11:52,980
(Miyeong) Well, it's true
the timing isn't that great...

236
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:54,814
But if you give up?

237
00:11:56,616 --> 00:11:58,452
Would you be okay with that?

238
00:12:02,756 --> 00:12:06,367
You should think about

239
00:12:06,852 --> 00:12:08,161
what you truly want.

240
00:12:12,513 --> 00:12:13,694
[music stops]

241
00:12:13,761 --> 00:12:14,767
[faint sigh]

242
00:12:15,702 --> 00:12:17,303
[emotional music plays]

243
00:12:25,512 --> 00:12:27,015
(Hagi) Sungwook said...

244
00:12:27,814 --> 00:12:31,318
that he hated how he felt
toward someone he should be supporting.

245
00:12:31,985 --> 00:12:33,653
[deep sigh]

246
00:12:35,054 --> 00:12:36,390
It sounded like how I felt.

247
00:12:37,323 --> 00:12:38,358
[faint sigh]

248
00:12:39,159 --> 00:12:41,527
I know it's a good opportunity
for Ms. Nam,

249
00:12:45,053 --> 00:12:46,715
but I don't want her to go.

250
00:12:49,733 --> 00:12:51,033
And I feel so pathetic
for feeling that way.

251
00:12:52,372 --> 00:12:53,507
[sighs]

252
00:12:54,634 --> 00:12:56,467
I should be used...

253
00:13:00,746 --> 00:13:02,315
to people leaving me by now,

254
00:13:04,950 --> 00:13:06,319
but it's still hard for me.

255
00:13:09,484 --> 00:13:10,991
(Minwoo) Then...
[pouring]

256
00:13:11,058 --> 00:13:13,693
just ask her to stay.

257
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,895
[pouring]
If I stop her from going
just because of me,

258
00:13:16,329 --> 00:13:18,731
[clunks]
then I'd be holding her back
from her dreams.

259
00:13:19,366 --> 00:13:20,500
Wow!

260
00:13:20,567 --> 00:13:21,679
[taps]

261
00:13:23,036 --> 00:13:24,203
I should let her go.

262
00:13:27,096 --> 00:13:28,637
[deep sigh]

263
00:13:29,954 --> 00:13:31,077
That's the right thing to do.

264
00:13:31,883 --> 00:13:32,912
[sighs]

265
00:13:35,214 --> 00:13:36,015
[sighs]

266
00:13:36,082 --> 00:13:37,818
You're hopeless.
[taps]

267
00:13:41,048 --> 00:13:41,988
[clunks]

268
00:13:45,181 --> 00:13:46,927
[sighs]

269
00:13:46,994 --> 00:13:48,500
[Hagi grunts]
(Minwoo) Hey, be careful.

270
00:13:48,567 --> 00:13:49,865
[Minwoo inhales]
[Hagi grunts]
[cheerful music]

271
00:13:49,932 --> 00:13:51,267
Hey, get a grip.

272
00:13:51,334 --> 00:13:53,166
- (Hagi) Hey...
- (Minwoo) Kang Hagi!

273
00:13:53,233 --> 00:13:54,233
Kang Hagi!

274
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:55,768
Hey. I'm fine.

275
00:13:56,170 --> 00:13:57,303
(Hagi) I mean it, I'm fine.

276
00:13:57,905 --> 00:13:58,905
Let's go for another round!

277
00:13:59,772 --> 00:14:00,841
My place!

278
00:14:02,142 --> 00:14:04,238
(Minwoo) You have to make
a drunk confession.

279
00:14:04,305 --> 00:14:05,462
You can't get wasted!

280
00:14:05,529 --> 00:14:06,539
All right.

281
00:14:07,759 --> 00:14:08,781
I'm going to do it!

282
00:14:09,148 --> 00:14:10,216
Drunk confession!

283
00:14:10,283 --> 00:14:11,617
- Okay.
- (Hagi) Let's do this!

284
00:14:11,684 --> 00:14:12,886
[Minwoo grunts]
(Dareum) Mr. Kang!

285
00:14:12,953 --> 00:14:13,946
Mr. Kang.

286
00:14:14,354 --> 00:14:15,355
[Dareum gasps]

287
00:14:16,033 --> 00:14:17,023
[whoosh sound]

288
00:14:17,090 --> 00:14:18,024
(Hagi) What?

289
00:14:18,525 --> 00:14:19,892
[Dareum, Minwoo laugh awkwardly]

290
00:14:19,959 --> 00:14:21,031
(Dareum) You can go ahead.

291
00:14:21,098 --> 00:14:23,009
- It's Ms. Nam.
- (Dareum) Yeah...

292
00:14:23,076 --> 00:14:23,966
[laughs]

293
00:14:24,033 --> 00:14:24,831
Ms. Nam.

294
00:14:24,898 --> 00:14:25,865
Yeah...

295
00:14:25,932 --> 00:14:26,966
(Hagi) Ms. Nam.
[comical sound]

296
00:14:27,033 --> 00:14:27,867
[reacts]

297
00:14:27,934 --> 00:14:28,902
(Dareum) What?

298
00:14:28,969 --> 00:14:29,969
[comical sound]
[reacts]

299
00:14:30,229 --> 00:14:32,171
So cute.
[Dareum grunts]

300
00:14:32,238 --> 00:14:33,966
[comical sound]
[reacts]

301
00:14:34,033 --> 00:14:36,109
(Hagi) You're so cute, Dareum.

302
00:14:36,709 --> 00:14:37,744
(Dareum) Oh...

303
00:14:38,078 --> 00:14:40,079
I guess he's pretty drunk.

304
00:14:40,146 --> 00:14:41,114
[Dareum laughs awkwardly]

305
00:14:42,149 --> 00:14:42,999
[Dareum groans]

306
00:14:43,066 --> 00:14:44,951
How can I send you away
when you're so cute?

307
00:14:45,018 --> 00:14:46,567
[laughs awkwardly]

308
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:48,287
[comical sound]
[exclaims]

309
00:14:48,814 --> 00:14:50,056
Give me a kiss.
[kissing sound]

310
00:14:50,123 --> 00:14:52,164
[Hagi groans]
[Dareum grunts]

311
00:14:52,626 --> 00:14:54,361
(Minwoo) Are you kidding me?
[comical sound]
[music stops]

312
00:14:54,428 --> 00:14:55,828
Do it at home!
[Dareum exclaims]

313
00:14:55,895 --> 00:14:58,264
Mr. Kang! Are you okay?
[Minwoo groans]

314
00:14:58,331 --> 00:15:00,099
[intriguing music]
(Minwoo) I've never seen him
so drunk before.

315
00:15:00,166 --> 00:15:01,752
[Dareum grunts]
[Minwoo laughs awkwardly]

316
00:15:02,228 --> 00:15:04,730
(Minwoo) Let's take him home first.

317
00:15:04,797 --> 00:15:07,225
(Dareum) One, two, three!
[Dareum, Minwoo grunt]

318
00:15:07,292 --> 00:15:08,641
- (Minwoo) Let's go.
- (Dareum) Are you okay?

319
00:15:08,708 --> 00:15:10,343
(Hagi) Yeah. Someone just hit me, though.

320
00:15:10,410 --> 00:15:11,744
- (Minwoo) No.
- (Dareum) No one hit you.

321
00:15:11,811 --> 00:15:13,210
(Minwoo) Let's go.
[music fades]
[insects chirping]

322
00:15:13,277 --> 00:15:15,167
[Dareum sighs]
(Dareum) Why are you so...

323
00:15:15,782 --> 00:15:17,149
(Hagi) You should go too.

324
00:15:17,216 --> 00:15:18,767
I'm really fine.
[Dareum grunts]
[Hagi coughs]

325
00:15:18,834 --> 00:15:20,519
Why do you keep telling me to go?

326
00:15:20,586 --> 00:15:23,056
Here. Sit here for a moment.
[Hagi coughs]

327
00:15:24,358 --> 00:15:25,901
[Dareum gasps]

328
00:15:26,801 --> 00:15:28,361
[lively music]

329
00:15:39,405 --> 00:15:40,674
[plops]

330
00:15:43,934 --> 00:15:45,344
Mr. Kang?
[music stops]

331
00:15:45,934 --> 00:15:47,079
(Dareum) Mr. Kang?

332
00:15:48,733 --> 00:15:49,716
[faint laugh]

333
00:15:54,126 --> 00:15:55,221
[Dareum grunts]

334
00:15:58,251 --> 00:15:59,225
[sighs]

335
00:16:01,339 --> 00:16:02,895
(Hagi) Don't go...

336
00:16:10,784 --> 00:16:12,734
Don't go, Dareum.

337
00:16:14,243 --> 00:16:15,675
[calm music]

338
00:16:18,588 --> 00:16:19,946
[exhales]

339
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:22,734
[faint sigh]

340
00:16:35,574 --> 00:16:36,567
[faint sigh]

341
00:16:38,893 --> 00:16:40,900
(Minwoo) He's not okay with it at all.

342
00:16:42,202 --> 00:16:45,104
He just doesn't want to hold you back.

343
00:17:04,491 --> 00:17:06,131
[faint sigh]
[music stops]

344
00:17:17,577 --> 00:17:19,277
(Notebooks, toiletries)

345
00:17:19,302 --> 00:17:20,968
(Contact lens solution, cotton swabs)
[emotional music]

346
00:17:20,992 --> 00:17:24,092
(Neck pillow, supplements,
pain relief spray, instant noodles)

347
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,000
(Things to pack for Paris)

348
00:17:57,885 --> 00:17:59,082
[music stops]

349
00:18:01,481 --> 00:18:02,958
[wind blowing]

350
00:18:04,018 --> 00:18:06,653
(Wontae) Should we confirm these colors

351
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:08,254
for the brand, as you said?

352
00:18:08,667 --> 00:18:10,791
(Hyesu) The colors seem too light.

353
00:18:10,858 --> 00:18:13,701
What about this color for the jacket?

354
00:18:15,294 --> 00:18:17,176
(Miyeong) Ms. Nam took the day off.

355
00:18:17,243 --> 00:18:20,232
The application deadline's today,
but she hasn't applied yet.

356
00:18:27,908 --> 00:18:29,033
[faint sigh]

357
00:18:29,584 --> 00:18:31,277
[street noise]

358
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:34,341
[door opens]

359
00:18:34,947 --> 00:18:36,531
[slurps]
[door closes]

360
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:39,352
[ding sound]

361
00:18:40,701 --> 00:18:41,901
[bag rustles]

362
00:19:02,975 --> 00:19:04,975
(One, two, three, four, five,
let's do this)

363
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,523
[calm music]

364
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:10,983
(fans) D.N.X, D.N.X, D.N.X!

365
00:19:11,050 --> 00:19:13,701
[fans chant "D.N.X"]

366
00:19:20,226 --> 00:19:21,467
- (Hyeok) One.
- (Lee Chan) Two.

367
00:19:22,061 --> 00:19:23,462
- (Jinu) Three.
- (Taeo) Four.

368
00:19:23,529 --> 00:19:24,731
Five. Let's do this!

369
00:19:25,236 --> 00:19:26,832
(members) Let's do this!

370
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:36,600
(One, two, three, four)

371
00:19:37,624 --> 00:19:39,624
(Five, let's do this)

372
00:19:54,126 --> 00:19:55,495
[Dareum sighs]

373
00:19:55,562 --> 00:19:57,167
(Dareum) I feel so relaxed

374
00:19:57,860 --> 00:19:59,461
after deciding not to go.

375
00:19:59,528 --> 00:20:00,526
[street noise]

376
00:20:00,593 --> 00:20:01,601
[sighs]

377
00:20:02,802 --> 00:20:03,770
[sips]

378
00:20:04,570 --> 00:20:05,370
[Dareum exclaims]

379
00:20:06,569 --> 00:20:09,075
Right. What's so special
about Paris anyway?

380
00:20:09,555 --> 00:20:11,310
My friends are here,

381
00:20:11,377 --> 00:20:12,480
APPELLO is here...

382
00:20:13,945 --> 00:20:15,796
(Hagi) From now on, whatever happens,

383
00:20:15,863 --> 00:20:16,982
[whoosh sound]
[soft music]

384
00:20:17,049 --> 00:20:18,150
don't let go of my hand.

385
00:20:18,517 --> 00:20:19,690
[Dareum laughs]

386
00:20:20,712 --> 00:20:21,620
(Dareum) Okay.

387
00:20:23,023 --> 00:20:24,457
[whoosh sound]
[faint laugh]

388
00:20:24,992 --> 00:20:26,325
And Mr. Kang is here too.

389
00:20:30,212 --> 00:20:31,597
Right, Nam Dareum.

390
00:20:32,247 --> 00:20:34,634
You made the right choice!

391
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:41,133
[exclaims]

392
00:20:42,608 --> 00:20:43,477
That's sweet.

393
00:20:45,756 --> 00:20:47,067
[Dareum sighs]
[music stops]

394
00:20:47,581 --> 00:20:49,125
[insects chirping]

395
00:20:50,584 --> 00:20:52,225
[faint dog barking]

396
00:21:03,167 --> 00:21:04,077
[faint sigh]

397
00:21:08,129 --> 00:21:09,634
[faint laugh]
[soft music]

398
00:21:10,904 --> 00:21:11,868
[faint laugh]

399
00:21:12,892 --> 00:21:13,968
So you were alive.

400
00:21:15,008 --> 00:21:16,075
[faint laugh]

401
00:21:18,499 --> 00:21:19,445
(Roy) Chan.

402
00:21:20,019 --> 00:21:21,280
[laughs]

403
00:21:25,118 --> 00:21:26,986
(Lee Chan) I should have at least
been there for you.

404
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:29,521
I'm sorry.
[music stops]

405
00:21:30,890 --> 00:21:31,790
(Roy) Why would you feel sorry?

406
00:21:33,859 --> 00:21:34,760
[Lee Chan sighs]

407
00:21:34,827 --> 00:21:36,030
I let go of your hand.

408
00:21:38,538 --> 00:21:39,567
No, you didn't.

409
00:21:40,900 --> 00:21:42,102
I'm the one who ran away.

410
00:21:44,603 --> 00:21:45,739
[faint laugh]
[wistful music]

411
00:21:49,202 --> 00:21:50,323
[Lee Chan sighs]

412
00:21:50,776 --> 00:21:52,980
(Lee Chan) You would've been
the most scared,

413
00:21:53,345 --> 00:21:56,050
but I guess I was too young at the time.
I ran away as well.

414
00:22:00,891 --> 00:22:01,834
Let's...

415
00:22:03,722 --> 00:22:05,058
stop running away.

416
00:22:07,691 --> 00:22:08,661
Come back, Roy.

417
00:22:11,567 --> 00:22:12,698
[exhales]

418
00:22:13,193 --> 00:22:14,300
Would they...

419
00:22:14,800 --> 00:22:15,930
accept me?

420
00:22:18,799 --> 00:22:20,172
[inhales]

421
00:22:20,239 --> 00:22:23,677
They swear whenever your part plays
during practice.

422
00:22:24,904 --> 00:22:26,679
(Lee Chan) They pretend to hate you,

423
00:22:27,033 --> 00:22:28,047
but they're waiting for you.

424
00:22:32,986 --> 00:22:33,986
You saw the ad, right?

425
00:22:35,011 --> 00:22:36,755
[taps]
That's how they actually feel.

426
00:22:38,529 --> 00:22:39,567
[laughs]

427
00:22:40,594 --> 00:22:41,660
[Roy sniffles]

428
00:22:42,966 --> 00:22:43,939
[sniffles]

429
00:22:44,006 --> 00:22:44,964
[faint laugh]

430
00:22:46,232 --> 00:22:47,534
[Lee Chan, Roy laugh]

431
00:22:48,904 --> 00:22:50,603
[music stops]
[pats]

432
00:22:54,408 --> 00:22:55,708
[phone vibrating]

433
00:23:03,482 --> 00:23:05,180
(Hagi) You know the application deadline
is today, right?

434
00:23:05,819 --> 00:23:07,820
I'll wait until you come.
[calm music]

435
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:12,425
[Dareum gasps]

436
00:23:12,492 --> 00:23:13,842
[wind blowing]

437
00:23:14,695 --> 00:23:15,794
[sighs]

438
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:20,666
[taps]

439
00:23:21,790 --> 00:23:23,590
(You know the application deadline
is today, right?)

440
00:23:23,614 --> 00:23:24,614
(I'll wait until you come)

441
00:23:28,207 --> 00:23:29,208
[thuds]

442
00:23:42,689 --> 00:23:43,756
[faint sigh]

443
00:23:51,698 --> 00:23:53,966
[door opens]
[Dareum pants]

444
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,207
Ms. Nam.

445
00:24:00,274 --> 00:24:01,607
[Dareum pants]

446
00:24:01,674 --> 00:24:03,110
You were really waiting for me?

447
00:24:04,843 --> 00:24:05,812
(Hagi) Yes.

448
00:24:05,879 --> 00:24:06,901
[sighs]

449
00:24:09,550 --> 00:24:10,851
[wind blowing]

450
00:24:10,918 --> 00:24:12,507
(Hagi) You didn't submit your application.
[music stops]

451
00:24:14,259 --> 00:24:15,654
You made me worry all day.

452
00:24:18,225 --> 00:24:19,624
You...

453
00:24:19,691 --> 00:24:21,293
were pretending to be fine with it too.

454
00:24:22,027 --> 00:24:23,297
(Dareum) Did you think I wouldn't notice?

455
00:24:23,829 --> 00:24:25,460
I'm a pro at pretending to be okay.

456
00:24:26,488 --> 00:24:27,488
[Dareum laughs awkwardly]

457
00:24:27,555 --> 00:24:28,934
Is that why you ran away?

458
00:24:33,472 --> 00:24:34,410
No.

459
00:24:37,195 --> 00:24:39,554
(Dareum) It's because
I love working with you,

460
00:24:40,179 --> 00:24:41,380
eating with you,

461
00:24:42,081 --> 00:24:44,718
and spending time with you.

462
00:24:45,912 --> 00:24:47,319
That's why.

463
00:24:51,995 --> 00:24:54,159
I just want to stay by your side.

464
00:24:56,763 --> 00:24:57,600
Ms. Nam.

465
00:24:58,189 --> 00:24:59,865
(Dareum) If I have to choose,

466
00:25:02,114 --> 00:25:03,369
I choose you.

467
00:25:05,169 --> 00:25:06,672
[calm music]

468
00:25:16,215 --> 00:25:17,280
You're right.
[sighs]

469
00:25:18,005 --> 00:25:19,701
(Hagi) I didn't want to send you away.

470
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,234
I was worried that we might end up
being separated

471
00:25:26,625 --> 00:25:27,628
for good.

472
00:25:29,767 --> 00:25:31,263
But I guess...

473
00:25:35,384 --> 00:25:37,369
my love for you is bigger than my anxiety.

474
00:25:39,169 --> 00:25:40,472
What I hated more
was the idea of you not going

475
00:25:41,375 --> 00:25:42,474
because of me.

476
00:25:47,029 --> 00:25:48,313
When you talked about Paris,

477
00:25:50,005 --> 00:25:51,650
your eyes sparkled.

478
00:25:54,398 --> 00:25:55,821
That was the expression

479
00:25:58,362 --> 00:25:59,458
I fell in love with.

480
00:26:01,040 --> 00:26:03,862
That excited, happy expression.

481
00:26:05,663 --> 00:26:06,865
I want you...

482
00:26:09,255 --> 00:26:11,236
to keep living with that expression.

483
00:26:19,423 --> 00:26:20,834
So don't worry about me and go.

484
00:26:21,955 --> 00:26:23,321
Look at lots of things,
[music stops]

485
00:26:24,151 --> 00:26:25,350
and experience lots of things.

486
00:26:29,251 --> 00:26:30,667
It will help you

487
00:26:31,681 --> 00:26:34,059
do what you want even better.

488
00:26:40,445 --> 00:26:41,667
You won't just let go of me...

489
00:26:45,339 --> 00:26:47,072
because I'm leaving, right?

490
00:26:49,810 --> 00:26:50,843
Of course not.

491
00:26:52,311 --> 00:26:53,680
I'm going to hold onto you even tighter.

492
00:26:54,346 --> 00:26:55,749
[tender music]

493
00:26:57,484 --> 00:26:58,383
(Hagi) Let's put...

494
00:26:59,119 --> 00:27:00,185
our faith in each other.

495
00:27:04,491 --> 00:27:05,491
[faint laugh]

496
00:27:06,693 --> 00:27:07,626
Okay?

497
00:27:08,861 --> 00:27:09,890
(Dareum) Okay.

498
00:27:11,632 --> 00:27:12,698
[faint laugh]

499
00:27:28,215 --> 00:27:29,667
[wind blowing]
[music stops]

500
00:27:30,284 --> 00:27:32,333
[murmuring]
(Mina) Congratulations, Ms. Nam.

501
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:34,602
I can't believe you're going to Paris.
That's so cool.

502
00:27:34,669 --> 00:27:35,400
[Dareum laughs]

503
00:27:35,467 --> 00:27:37,422
(Yeongwoo) Promise to upload photos
in our group chat.
[Dareum reacts]

504
00:27:37,489 --> 00:27:39,191
(Miyeong) You have to come back, okay?

505
00:27:39,258 --> 00:27:41,801
Yes. I promise to keep in touch.

506
00:27:41,868 --> 00:27:43,562
- (Yeongwoo, Mina) Cheers!
- (Dareum) I'll miss you.

507
00:27:43,629 --> 00:27:45,599
(Jinsang) Hey, what about us?
Don't leave us out!
[cheerful music]

508
00:27:45,666 --> 00:27:48,167
- (Dareum) Cheers.
- (employees) Cheers!

509
00:27:56,109 --> 00:27:57,067
I...

510
00:27:57,411 --> 00:27:59,205
(Hagi) have something to tell you all.

511
00:28:04,651 --> 00:28:05,752
(Dareum) Oh, my gosh!

512
00:28:05,819 --> 00:28:07,252
[taps feet]
Mr. Kang!

513
00:28:09,452 --> 00:28:10,701
To be honest...
[Dareum gasps]

514
00:28:12,685 --> 00:28:14,644
(Hagi) Ms. Nam and I...
[Dareum sighs]

515
00:28:14,711 --> 00:28:16,676
(Miyeong) We know, Mr. Kang.
[comical side effect]
[music stops]

516
00:28:18,847 --> 00:28:20,832
(Mina) Wow. Congratulations.

517
00:28:20,899 --> 00:28:22,634
(Wontae) Congratulations.
[employees cheer]

518
00:28:22,701 --> 00:28:23,700
(Jinsang) Finally.

519
00:28:24,518 --> 00:28:26,033
[cheerful music]

520
00:28:26,740 --> 00:28:29,241
I haven't finished talking yet...

521
00:28:29,308 --> 00:28:31,011
(Jinsang) Do you know how tiring it was

522
00:28:31,078 --> 00:28:32,933
to pretend not to notice you two?

523
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:35,347
(Hyesu) Yeah. It was exhausting.

524
00:28:35,414 --> 00:28:36,915
(Wontae) Seriously.

525
00:28:36,982 --> 00:28:38,683
(Yeongwoo) It was funny
seeing your awkward acting.

526
00:28:38,750 --> 00:28:40,725
[everyone laughs]

527
00:28:44,035 --> 00:28:47,259
We won't be able
to have gatherings for a while.

528
00:28:47,759 --> 00:28:50,898
It was always just the two of us anyway...

529
00:28:52,478 --> 00:28:54,468
[comical sound]
[Jinsang coughs]
(Jinsang) Coke...

530
00:28:54,535 --> 00:28:57,501
[coughing]
Can you give me some Coke?
[bell ringing sound]

531
00:28:57,868 --> 00:28:59,033
[employees talking]

532
00:28:59,100 --> 00:29:00,138
(Dareum) Mr. Kang...

533
00:29:00,739 --> 00:29:01,708
[music stops]
[laughs awkwardly]

534
00:29:02,509 --> 00:29:04,142
[Dareum, Hagi laugh]

535
00:29:07,469 --> 00:29:09,322
(members) One, two, three, four,

536
00:29:09,389 --> 00:29:11,383
five, six, seven, eight.

537
00:29:11,450 --> 00:29:14,267
- Two, two, three, four...
- (Hyeok) Wait. Chan.

538
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:16,148
You're half a beat fast.

539
00:29:16,215 --> 00:29:18,190
No, I moved at "two, two."

540
00:29:18,257 --> 00:29:20,211
- (Lee Chan) I moved at "two."
- (Jinu) Both of you were fast.

541
00:29:20,278 --> 00:29:21,059
- (Taeo) Again.
- (Lee Chan) What...

542
00:29:21,126 --> 00:29:22,360
(Taeo) You were both wrong,
so get back in position.

543
00:29:22,427 --> 00:29:24,216
- (Hyeok) Hey, Taeo...
- (Lee Chan) Okay, fine. I got it wrong.

544
00:29:24,283 --> 00:29:26,064
- Let's do it again.
- (Hyeok) Taeo, you know it's...

545
00:29:26,131 --> 00:29:27,570
- (Taeo) That's not it.
- (Jinu) Hurry up.

546
00:29:32,104 --> 00:29:33,510
[tender music]
You're here.

547
00:29:40,646 --> 00:29:42,549
I'm a bit late, aren't I?

548
00:29:43,892 --> 00:29:44,883
[sighs]

549
00:29:52,793 --> 00:29:54,790
[sighs]
We've been waiting for you...

550
00:29:56,096 --> 00:29:57,234
[laughs]

551
00:30:02,067 --> 00:30:03,465
(Jinu) I missed you!

552
00:30:03,532 --> 00:30:04,469
(Taeo) Me too...

553
00:30:04,536 --> 00:30:05,637
(Jinu) Let me see your face.

554
00:30:05,704 --> 00:30:06,600
How have you all been?

555
00:30:06,667 --> 00:30:09,140
(Jinu) Hey, what have you been through?
What happened to your idol face?

556
00:30:09,207 --> 00:30:11,077
- (Hyeok) Right?
- (Taeo) He looks better than you guys.

557
00:30:11,144 --> 00:30:12,577
What are you saying?
[Roy laughs]

558
00:30:15,180 --> 00:30:17,380
(Lee Chan) Hey!
[members exclaim]

559
00:30:18,583 --> 00:30:21,256
[members cheer]

560
00:30:21,323 --> 00:30:23,288
[members cheer]

561
00:30:23,355 --> 00:30:24,820
(Lee Chan) What took you so long?
[music stops]

562
00:30:27,237 --> 00:30:30,237
(The Collegeist pop-up has ended)

563
00:30:33,862 --> 00:30:35,621
[D.N.X's "Dear My Light" plays]

564
00:30:54,273 --> 00:30:55,555
[taps]

565
00:30:55,622 --> 00:30:57,022
Can you play this song?

566
00:30:58,125 --> 00:30:59,157
(Dareum) What?

567
00:31:00,494 --> 00:31:01,526
[laughs]

568
00:31:02,496 --> 00:31:06,364
[fan song "YOU" plays]
(Lee Chan in song) <i>When the world
shakes me</i>

569
00:31:06,431 --> 00:31:10,604
<i>And I lose myself</i>

570
00:31:11,762 --> 00:31:16,361
<i>In every moment and every place</i>

571
00:31:16,428 --> 00:31:20,991
<i>We'll dream together again</i>

572
00:31:21,058 --> 00:31:21,780
What do you think?

573
00:31:22,513 --> 00:31:24,516
<i>Only you</i>

574
00:31:24,583 --> 00:31:25,619
It's good.

575
00:31:27,662 --> 00:31:28,634
(Lee Chan) That's it?

576
00:31:29,256 --> 00:31:30,422
[laughs awkwardly]

577
00:31:33,291 --> 00:31:34,160
It feels strange.

578
00:31:34,418 --> 00:31:35,300
[faint laugh]

579
00:31:35,367 --> 00:31:37,167
(Dareum) You're saying
those words to your fans,

580
00:31:37,931 --> 00:31:40,399
but they're words
I wanted to say to you too.

581
00:31:41,748 --> 00:31:42,668
[Dareum laughs]

582
00:31:44,669 --> 00:31:46,040
(Lee Chan) So...
[music stops]

583
00:31:47,172 --> 00:31:48,242
you're saying it's a pass?

584
00:31:52,228 --> 00:31:53,478
[Dareum grunts]

585
00:31:53,981 --> 00:31:55,480
[Dareum, Lee Chan laugh]

586
00:31:58,282 --> 00:31:59,472
[sighs]

587
00:31:59,539 --> 00:32:01,850
We both held on for a long time.

588
00:32:05,118 --> 00:32:06,725
(Dareum) What? That's...

589
00:32:06,792 --> 00:32:08,190
[soft music]

590
00:32:10,030 --> 00:32:11,029
[gasps]

591
00:32:11,430 --> 00:32:12,297
(Dareum) This...

592
00:32:12,364 --> 00:32:15,000
[whoosh sound]
is actually the shape
that a celebrity I love

593
00:32:15,067 --> 00:32:16,924
always draws in his autograph.

594
00:32:16,991 --> 00:32:18,870
Today's my birthday,

595
00:32:18,937 --> 00:32:20,905
and I really want to gift that to myself.

596
00:32:20,972 --> 00:32:21,740
(Lee Chan) Excuse me!

597
00:32:22,442 --> 00:32:23,408
Happy birthday.

598
00:32:26,601 --> 00:32:27,440
[Lee Chan laughs]

599
00:32:28,549 --> 00:32:29,548
(Lee Chan) It was me.

600
00:32:30,282 --> 00:32:32,150
[whoosh sound]
The one who gave you that pendant
on your birthday.

601
00:32:32,217 --> 00:32:33,285
[gasps]

602
00:32:34,321 --> 00:32:35,487
[faint laugh]

603
00:32:37,155 --> 00:32:39,020
Seeing you still keep that...

604
00:32:40,026 --> 00:32:41,860
gave me the courage to go back onstage.

605
00:32:43,839 --> 00:32:45,063
[exhales]

606
00:32:45,897 --> 00:32:48,802
I stayed strong,
believing that you gave this to me.

607
00:32:52,037 --> 00:32:53,140
[rattles]

608
00:32:56,406 --> 00:32:57,442
(Dareum) I...

609
00:32:59,446 --> 00:33:01,112
think I know what I really want

610
00:33:01,648 --> 00:33:02,747
to do now.

611
00:33:04,049 --> 00:33:06,250
Just like how I was happy as your fan,

612
00:33:06,705 --> 00:33:07,686
I...

613
00:33:08,124 --> 00:33:10,255
also want to do something
that would make

614
00:33:10,991 --> 00:33:12,023
people's hearts race.

615
00:33:13,227 --> 00:33:14,826
[inhales]

616
00:33:17,128 --> 00:33:18,560
That's why you're going to Paris, right?

617
00:33:20,940 --> 00:33:21,900
(Dareum) Yes.

618
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:24,600
Though I'm not sure
if I can do a good job.

619
00:33:25,403 --> 00:33:26,600
I'm sure you'll do great.

620
00:33:27,539 --> 00:33:28,510
(Lee Chan) I've seen...

621
00:33:28,877 --> 00:33:30,680
how sincere you are.

622
00:33:31,178 --> 00:33:32,277
[laughs awkwardly]

623
00:33:35,449 --> 00:33:38,383
I was happy to know that I had
such an amazing fan.

624
00:33:43,862 --> 00:33:44,868
So you should try

625
00:33:46,078 --> 00:33:47,259
making other people's hearts race too.

626
00:33:54,801 --> 00:33:55,767
[laughs]

627
00:33:56,803 --> 00:33:57,869
[faint laugh]

628
00:33:59,723 --> 00:34:00,939
[exhales]

629
00:34:02,063 --> 00:34:02,940
[music stops]

630
00:34:03,177 --> 00:34:04,576
[faint dog barking]

631
00:34:05,677 --> 00:34:06,680
Passport.

632
00:34:07,238 --> 00:34:08,148
Check.

633
00:34:08,215 --> 00:34:08,934
[cheerful music]

634
00:34:09,001 --> 00:34:09,948
(Hagi) Guidebook.

635
00:34:10,907 --> 00:34:11,901
[taps]
(Dareum) Check.

636
00:34:12,959 --> 00:34:13,901
Basic medicine.

637
00:34:14,567 --> 00:34:15,620
[faint laugh]

638
00:34:16,354 --> 00:34:18,260
[taps]
(Dareum) You packed
a whole pharmacy for me.

639
00:34:19,501 --> 00:34:20,549
[Hagi sighs]

640
00:34:20,616 --> 00:34:21,868
(Hagi) Will this be enough?

641
00:34:24,062 --> 00:34:25,360
(Dareum) I'm not going to Paris
to sell medicine.

642
00:34:25,999 --> 00:34:27,499
I just don't want you to get sick.

643
00:34:27,966 --> 00:34:28,869
[scoffs]

644
00:34:29,757 --> 00:34:31,302
[Dareum inhales and grunts]
[taps]

645
00:34:31,369 --> 00:34:33,813
I think I've got everything.
[music stops]

646
00:34:35,574 --> 00:34:37,244
[rustles]

647
00:34:43,483 --> 00:34:44,467
(Hagi) You hung...

648
00:34:45,369 --> 00:34:46,580
the keychain we made.

649
00:34:47,020 --> 00:34:48,100
[Dareum laughs]

650
00:34:49,888 --> 00:34:51,325
(Dareum) I'm going to take this with me

651
00:34:51,692 --> 00:34:53,358
so I'll feel like you're with me.

652
00:34:55,026 --> 00:34:56,560
[soft music]

653
00:35:04,371 --> 00:35:05,440
Are you touched?

654
00:35:08,340 --> 00:35:09,570
Yeah, a bit.

655
00:35:10,062 --> 00:35:11,109
A bit?

656
00:35:13,345 --> 00:35:14,180
A lot.

657
00:35:15,111 --> 00:35:16,147
[laughs]

658
00:35:17,481 --> 00:35:19,751
[Dareum inhales and grunts]
[clunks]

659
00:35:20,185 --> 00:35:22,022
I should leave something behind
for you too.

660
00:35:23,635 --> 00:35:24,623
(Hagi) What?

661
00:35:26,124 --> 00:35:27,990
That's a secret. I'll tell you later.

662
00:35:28,428 --> 00:35:30,053
[Dareum laughs]
[Hagi reacts]

663
00:35:35,834 --> 00:35:37,033
[Dareum sighs]

664
00:35:42,409 --> 00:35:43,734
I'll be back soon.

665
00:35:46,081 --> 00:35:47,278
I'll be waiting for you.

666
00:35:52,218 --> 00:35:53,218
[kisses]

667
00:36:06,834 --> 00:36:07,832
[music stops]

668
00:36:09,900 --> 00:36:12,900
(Dareum, Hagi)

669
00:36:13,400 --> 00:36:15,034
[airplane engine sound]

670
00:36:16,343 --> 00:36:18,538
(6 months later)
[writing sound]
[street sounds]

671
00:36:18,543 --> 00:36:19,980
[lively music]

672
00:36:22,447 --> 00:36:25,216
(secretary) [in French] Dareum,
Ms. Han wants this version by three.

673
00:36:25,750 --> 00:36:27,519
(Dareum) Three? Today?

674
00:36:28,086 --> 00:36:30,591
(secretary) Yes. You know what she's like.

675
00:36:30,889 --> 00:36:33,894
[in Korean] Gosh...
She really is a Korean, isn't she?

676
00:36:34,392 --> 00:36:35,262
(secretary) [in French] You can do it.

677
00:36:36,063 --> 00:36:37,264
[in Korean] You can...

678
00:36:37,331 --> 00:36:38,396
[laughs]

679
00:36:39,067 --> 00:36:40,131
(Dareum) Do it.

680
00:36:40,198 --> 00:36:42,070
(secretary) Yes!
[Dareum, secretary laugh]

681
00:36:44,469 --> 00:36:45,370
[sighs]

682
00:36:51,347 --> 00:36:52,240
[mouse clicking]

683
00:37:08,739 --> 00:37:09,734
[mouse clicking]

684
00:37:15,344 --> 00:37:16,367
[sighs]

685
00:37:19,901 --> 00:37:20,605
[exclaims]

686
00:37:20,672 --> 00:37:22,040
All done.

687
00:37:22,534 --> 00:37:23,842
[music stops]
[faint laugh]

688
00:37:27,279 --> 00:37:28,014
[sighs]

689
00:37:28,081 --> 00:37:29,681
[door opens]
[door lock sound]

690
00:37:35,019 --> 00:37:36,389
[door closes]
[door lock sound]

691
00:37:36,456 --> 00:37:37,889
[emotional music]

692
00:37:43,074 --> 00:37:44,434
[sighs]

693
00:37:52,803 --> 00:37:53,801
[clunks]

694
00:38:05,784 --> 00:38:08,922
[ding sound]
(Dareum) Missions for Hagi
while waiting for me.

695
00:38:09,423 --> 00:38:12,450
Water our plant and open the window
to give it sunlight.
[ding sound]

696
00:38:12,517 --> 00:38:15,393
When a new leaf grows,
take a selfie with it and send it to me.
[camera snapping sound]

697
00:38:15,460 --> 00:38:18,434
Show me the buds
on a video call when they appear.

698
00:38:25,570 --> 00:38:26,470
[faint sigh]

699
00:38:27,170 --> 00:38:28,206
[taps]

700
00:38:45,397 --> 00:38:47,327
- (employee 1) [in English] Bye.
- (Dareum) Bye-bye.
[music stops]

701
00:38:47,394 --> 00:38:48,459
[Dareum laughs]

702
00:38:51,711 --> 00:38:53,767
[phone vibrating]

703
00:38:56,196 --> 00:38:57,130
[Dareum gasps]

704
00:38:57,836 --> 00:38:58,746
[taps]

705
00:38:58,813 --> 00:38:59,901
[laughs]

706
00:38:59,968 --> 00:39:01,058
[in French] Hi!

707
00:39:01,125 --> 00:39:02,501
[cheerful music]

708
00:39:03,107 --> 00:39:04,184
(Hagi) [in Korean] It's the weekend.
Are you at work?

709
00:39:04,251 --> 00:39:05,290
[sighs]

710
00:39:05,357 --> 00:39:06,333
[Dareum groans]

711
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:07,501
(Dareum) Yes!

712
00:39:08,079 --> 00:39:10,417
Ms. Han really is no joke.

713
00:39:10,484 --> 00:39:12,583
She gives me mountains of work.

714
00:39:12,650 --> 00:39:14,051
She's even worse than you.

715
00:39:14,118 --> 00:39:16,090
(Hagi) But why do you look so happy?

716
00:39:16,432 --> 00:39:17,789
[Dareum laughs]

717
00:39:18,223 --> 00:39:20,490
(Dareum) It's tough, but it's fun.

718
00:39:21,098 --> 00:39:22,567
If it's tough but still fun,

719
00:39:23,197 --> 00:39:24,200
that means you're doing a good job.

720
00:39:24,996 --> 00:39:26,634
(Dareum) Gosh...
[laughs awkwardly]

721
00:39:26,701 --> 00:39:28,170
You really talk like a CEO.

722
00:39:28,733 --> 00:39:29,767
(Hagi) Well, I am a CEO.

723
00:39:30,935 --> 00:39:31,903
[Dareum scoffs]

724
00:39:33,388 --> 00:39:35,267
(Dareum) What about APPELLO?
Is everything going well?

725
00:39:35,740 --> 00:39:37,844
(Hagi) Right. I just found out yesterday

726
00:39:37,911 --> 00:39:39,446
that Park Yeongwoo
and Lee Mina are dating.

727
00:39:39,513 --> 00:39:40,545
(Dareum) Really?

728
00:39:41,203 --> 00:39:43,714
I knew they'd end up dating.

729
00:39:43,781 --> 00:39:44,520
Since when?

730
00:39:45,117 --> 00:39:46,834
(Hagi) Last week.
[Dareum gasps]

731
00:39:46,901 --> 00:39:48,323
(Dareum) No way.

732
00:39:48,390 --> 00:39:49,420
How did you find out?

733
00:39:49,823 --> 00:39:51,558
(Hagi) It was just so obvious.

734
00:39:51,625 --> 00:39:52,467
They're the only ones who don't know.

735
00:39:52,534 --> 00:39:53,925
[laughs]

736
00:39:54,873 --> 00:39:57,495
It was the same for us, you know.

737
00:39:58,446 --> 00:39:59,866
[Hagi laughs]

738
00:39:59,933 --> 00:40:01,793
(Hagi) Right. Look at this.

739
00:40:03,368 --> 00:40:04,339
I think it'll bloom soon.

740
00:40:04,406 --> 00:40:06,488
Wow, it's so pretty!

741
00:40:06,555 --> 00:40:08,082
[swish sound]
(Dareum) How are you so good at this?

742
00:40:08,149 --> 00:40:10,333
[ding sound]
I always killed off my plants.

743
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:11,144
[whoosh sound]

744
00:40:11,211 --> 00:40:12,567
- (Hagi) You're grateful, aren't you?
- (Dareum) Yeah.

745
00:40:12,634 --> 00:40:13,611
[Dareum laughs]

746
00:40:14,337 --> 00:40:15,267
(Hagi) Then give me a reward.

747
00:40:16,223 --> 00:40:17,248
[Dareum reacts]

748
00:40:18,736 --> 00:40:20,100
[kissing sound]
[ding sound]

749
00:40:20,167 --> 00:40:21,719
[Dareum laughs]
[Hagi laughs]

750
00:40:23,788 --> 00:40:24,825
I miss you.

751
00:40:25,556 --> 00:40:26,320
(Hagi) Me too.

752
00:40:26,634 --> 00:40:27,667
[laughs]

753
00:40:27,734 --> 00:40:29,345
[music stops]
[sparkling sound]

754
00:40:29,412 --> 00:40:30,561
[Dareum grunts]

755
00:40:32,300 --> 00:40:34,966
(Minwoo) Dareum will go
to the concert venue herself,

756
00:40:35,033 --> 00:40:36,601
and I can take you there.

757
00:40:36,668 --> 00:40:38,460
How will Seula come?
[beeping sound]

758
00:40:38,527 --> 00:40:39,670
Will she come alone?

759
00:40:39,737 --> 00:40:42,106
Or should I give her a ride?
[playful music]

760
00:40:42,673 --> 00:40:43,563
[taps]
[grunts]

761
00:40:43,630 --> 00:40:44,604
[whoosh sound]

762
00:40:45,821 --> 00:40:46,911
Keep your eyes ahead.

763
00:40:46,978 --> 00:40:48,534
[warning beep sound]
Eyes ahead.

764
00:40:49,449 --> 00:40:50,870
[screeching sound]
[music fades]

765
00:40:52,435 --> 00:40:53,651
(Minwoo) Eyes ahead.

766
00:40:53,718 --> 00:40:56,020
(Seula) Hi, this is Fan Goods Shop.
[rustling]

767
00:40:56,087 --> 00:40:56,888
[lively music]

768
00:40:56,955 --> 00:40:58,859
Oh, yes. The slogan banners?

769
00:40:59,551 --> 00:41:02,233
"Take all my money, Hoon"?

770
00:41:02,300 --> 00:41:04,560
We're out of stock at the moment.

771
00:41:04,627 --> 00:41:05,678
"You stole my heart, Min"?

772
00:41:05,745 --> 00:41:07,655
This will be back in stock tomorrow.

773
00:41:07,722 --> 00:41:09,554
150 of those? Okay.

774
00:41:09,621 --> 00:41:11,135
All right.

775
00:41:11,202 --> 00:41:12,706
Yes, of course. They'll be ready soon.

776
00:41:13,266 --> 00:41:14,138
Okay!

777
00:41:14,671 --> 00:41:16,173
(Lee Chan) One, two, three.

778
00:41:16,240 --> 00:41:18,110
[members chant]

779
00:41:21,577 --> 00:41:23,721
[members chant]

780
00:41:24,785 --> 00:41:26,000
[members cheer]

781
00:41:26,517 --> 00:41:27,454
Nice.

782
00:41:36,118 --> 00:41:37,561
(D.N.X Reunites for Full Group Comeback)
[whoosh sound]

783
00:41:38,398 --> 00:41:39,330
[Dareum gasps]

784
00:41:40,031 --> 00:41:41,934
[intriguing sound]
(Dareum) I can't believe it!

785
00:41:44,030 --> 00:41:46,398
[gasps]

786
00:42:02,520 --> 00:42:03,888
[employees laugh]
[music stops]

787
00:42:03,955 --> 00:42:06,360
[clapping]
(Miyeong) All right, everyone!

788
00:42:07,531 --> 00:42:08,333
You know what it is, right?

789
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:09,493
[employees exclaim]

790
00:42:09,560 --> 00:42:11,200
(Jinsang) It's time!

791
00:42:12,158 --> 00:42:13,131
(Miyeong) All right!

792
00:42:13,534 --> 00:42:15,300
This is a rite of passage

793
00:42:15,367 --> 00:42:18,336
for every new employee at APPELLO.

794
00:42:19,072 --> 00:42:20,939
So, Chaeeun.

795
00:42:21,308 --> 00:42:23,107
Are you Team Mr. Kang?

796
00:42:23,541 --> 00:42:24,316
Or Team Director Lee?

797
00:42:24,383 --> 00:42:25,273
Or Team Jinsang?
[ding sound]

798
00:42:25,340 --> 00:42:26,610
[employees boo]

799
00:42:26,677 --> 00:42:27,611
[snaps]
[Jinsang grunts]

800
00:42:27,678 --> 00:42:28,612
[employees laugh]

801
00:42:28,679 --> 00:42:29,467
(Jinsang) I'm sure there's someone...

802
00:42:29,534 --> 00:42:31,618
- (Miyeong) Shh! Quiet!
- (employee 2) There's no one.

803
00:42:31,685 --> 00:42:32,701
[Chaeeun clears throat]

804
00:42:33,487 --> 00:42:34,693
Well...

805
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:37,287
[exciting music]
[Chaeeun groans]

806
00:42:41,395 --> 00:42:44,629
[Chaeeun continues groaning]

807
00:42:45,180 --> 00:42:46,666
[ding sound]
Team Mr. Kang.

808
00:42:46,733 --> 00:42:48,751
[employees gasp]

809
00:42:49,770 --> 00:42:51,631
[chattering]

810
00:42:53,307 --> 00:42:56,174
[Mina laughs]
(Yeongwoo) She used to be
Team Mr. Kang too.

811
00:42:56,915 --> 00:42:59,276
[intriguing music]
[Yeongwoo groans]
I'm Team Yeongwoo now.

812
00:42:59,343 --> 00:43:00,111
That hurt.

813
00:43:00,178 --> 00:43:02,499
(Jinsang) I told you not to show off
that you're dating.

814
00:43:02,566 --> 00:43:04,015
(Hyesu) Jeez...
[employees laugh]

815
00:43:04,082 --> 00:43:05,683
- (Chaeeun) By the way...
- (Miyeong) Yes?

816
00:43:05,750 --> 00:43:07,487
Is Mr. Kang single?

817
00:43:08,820 --> 00:43:10,424
[employees sigh]

818
00:43:12,426 --> 00:43:13,453
(Hagi) Yes.
[music stops]

819
00:43:13,520 --> 00:43:16,560
Compile the preferred-brand data
separately for the US and Europe.

820
00:43:16,922 --> 00:43:18,534
[footsteps echo]
[uplifting music]

821
00:43:35,048 --> 00:43:37,851
[music stops]
(Chaeeun) I mean, he's always working...

822
00:43:37,918 --> 00:43:38,933
[Jinsang laughs]

823
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:40,300
(Jinsang) All right!
[snaps]

824
00:43:40,767 --> 00:43:42,186
[in a singing voice] Shall I tell you

825
00:43:42,253 --> 00:43:45,125
whether he's dating someone or not?

826
00:43:45,601 --> 00:43:46,801
[Jinsang pants]

827
00:43:46,868 --> 00:43:49,467
Oh, I'm sorry, sir...
[employees laugh]

828
00:43:49,927 --> 00:43:51,328
- (employee 2) I knew this would happen.
- (Jinsang) Gosh.

829
00:43:51,395 --> 00:43:52,630
(Dareum) Too bad.

830
00:43:53,218 --> 00:43:54,101
He's seeing someone.

831
00:43:54,168 --> 00:43:56,032
[uplifting music]
[employees gasp]

832
00:43:57,371 --> 00:43:59,303
(Yeongwoo) Ms. Nam!
[employees cheer and clap]

833
00:44:00,674 --> 00:44:03,210
(Dareum) I've just returned to Korea!

834
00:44:03,277 --> 00:44:05,476
[employees cheer and clap]

835
00:44:09,683 --> 00:44:11,084
(Wontae) What?

836
00:44:11,151 --> 00:44:12,817
[Dareum cheers]

837
00:44:14,021 --> 00:44:15,750
[sounds grow silent]

838
00:44:24,566 --> 00:44:25,932
(Yeongwoo) When did you get here?

839
00:44:26,264 --> 00:44:28,101
Wow!
[music stops]

840
00:44:30,801 --> 00:44:31,738
Weren't you coming tomorrow?

841
00:44:32,570 --> 00:44:33,640
I came a day early.

842
00:44:35,130 --> 00:44:36,073
Why?

843
00:44:37,575 --> 00:44:38,567
[faint laugh]

844
00:44:38,634 --> 00:44:39,510
Because I missed you.

845
00:44:39,577 --> 00:44:41,417
[employees cheer]
[music: "My Bias, My Boss" theme song]

846
00:44:51,992 --> 00:44:53,191
[Dareum laughs]

847
00:44:59,420 --> 00:45:00,879
[Dareum laughs]
[music stops]

848
00:45:05,238 --> 00:45:06,437
[sighs]

849
00:45:08,647 --> 00:45:10,200
I'm really home.

850
00:45:15,007 --> 00:45:16,581
There's something we haven't done yet.

851
00:45:20,751 --> 00:45:21,788
[laughs]

852
00:45:26,905 --> 00:45:28,562
[emotional music]
[Dareum laughs]

853
00:45:31,862 --> 00:45:33,060
(Dareum) This must be why...

854
00:45:35,933 --> 00:45:37,802
I wanted to come back.

855
00:45:47,601 --> 00:45:48,679
[sighs]

856
00:45:56,557 --> 00:45:57,971
[wind blowing]
[birds singing]

857
00:45:58,038 --> 00:45:59,123
[music stops]

858
00:45:59,190 --> 00:46:01,429
(Wonbin) The employee in charge
of this project

859
00:46:01,496 --> 00:46:03,619
will present some fan merch proposals
for our comeback.

860
00:46:03,686 --> 00:46:05,596
Who's the employee?
[door opens]

861
00:46:08,199 --> 00:46:10,059
[door closes]
[papers rustle]

862
00:46:10,126 --> 00:46:12,436
- (Dareum) Hello.
- (members) Hello.

863
00:46:12,503 --> 00:46:13,534
(Dareum) Hello.

864
00:46:14,441 --> 00:46:15,932
[upbeat music]

865
00:46:15,999 --> 00:46:19,081
I'm Nam Dareum,
and I'll be working with you

866
00:46:19,105 --> 00:46:20,387
on the D.N.X collaboration project.

867
00:46:20,454 --> 00:46:22,567
Nice to meet you all!
[members clap]

868
00:46:23,214 --> 00:46:24,110
[Jinu cheers]

869
00:46:25,085 --> 00:46:27,348
(Wonbin) We look forward
to working with you.

870
00:46:27,415 --> 00:46:29,453
Then shall we begin?

871
00:46:30,870 --> 00:46:32,011
(Dareum) For this collaboration,

872
00:46:32,035 --> 00:46:34,234
we took inspiration
from the fan song "YOU."

873
00:46:34,301 --> 00:46:36,734
We wanted to reflect
your gratitude to the fans

874
00:46:36,801 --> 00:46:38,729
who have waited for you in the merch.

875
00:46:38,796 --> 00:46:41,935
As you can see here,
we planned three types,

876
00:46:42,002 --> 00:46:44,286
T-shirts, tote bags, and caps.

877
00:46:44,353 --> 00:46:45,551
Starting with the T-shirt,

878
00:46:45,575 --> 00:46:47,415
you'll notice that
there are special details.

879
00:46:47,482 --> 00:46:51,642
On the left chest pocket,
closest to the heart,

880
00:46:51,709 --> 00:46:54,047
there are lyrics from the fan song
embroidered in elegant lettering.

881
00:46:54,114 --> 00:46:55,782
[members talking]

882
00:46:55,849 --> 00:46:56,881
[music stops]

883
00:46:58,151 --> 00:46:59,180
(Lee Chan) You were really cool today.

884
00:46:59,513 --> 00:47:02,152
Come on. You're flattering me.
[laughs awkwardly]

885
00:47:02,219 --> 00:47:03,350
I mean it.

886
00:47:04,613 --> 00:47:06,267
(Lee Chan) We're really
working together now.

887
00:47:07,067 --> 00:47:08,460
(Dareum) That's why I have to do my best.

888
00:47:09,086 --> 00:47:11,200
I won't be working on this project
just as a fan.

889
00:47:11,529 --> 00:47:12,399
Then?

890
00:47:12,466 --> 00:47:15,530
I'm an employee
who understands your fans as well.

891
00:47:16,003 --> 00:47:16,730
[exclaims]

892
00:47:17,501 --> 00:47:18,906
(Lee Chan) Then I look forward
to working with you,

893
00:47:19,437 --> 00:47:21,141
Ms. Nam Dareum.

894
00:47:22,209 --> 00:47:23,708
[soft music]

895
00:47:25,885 --> 00:47:28,350
(Dareum) All right, Mr. Lee Chan.

896
00:47:28,646 --> 00:47:29,583
(Lee Chan) All right.

897
00:47:29,650 --> 00:47:31,115
[Lee Chan, Dareum laugh]

898
00:47:32,757 --> 00:47:34,018
- Let's do this.
- Let's do this.

899
00:47:42,229 --> 00:47:43,601
[door closes]
(Hagi) That was...

900
00:47:44,114 --> 00:47:45,129
a great briefing.

901
00:47:46,482 --> 00:47:48,001
[laughs awkwardly]
You heard?
[music stops]

902
00:47:48,068 --> 00:47:49,370
I could hear everything outside.

903
00:47:49,864 --> 00:47:51,131
(Hagi) You had such a confident voice.

904
00:47:51,198 --> 00:47:52,469
[laughs awkwardly]

905
00:47:52,536 --> 00:47:54,170
I think you're ready
for a bigger project now.

906
00:47:55,499 --> 00:47:57,808
Are you trying to make me work overtime
after complimenting me?

907
00:47:59,043 --> 00:48:00,040
I can't work late today.

908
00:48:01,209 --> 00:48:02,046
Why?

909
00:48:02,113 --> 00:48:03,617
I'm going on a date with my boyfriend.

910
00:48:04,704 --> 00:48:06,384
[bright music]

911
00:48:07,800 --> 00:48:08,700
[poking sound]

912
00:48:08,767 --> 00:48:10,187
[popping sound]
[ding sound]

913
00:48:19,695 --> 00:48:20,667
(Dareum) I think...

914
00:48:20,734 --> 00:48:21,766
the fans would like this...

915
00:48:23,000 --> 00:48:25,669
and this the most among the lyrics.

916
00:48:25,736 --> 00:48:27,338
[Yeongwoo snaps fingers]
- (Chaeeun) Okay.
- (Dareum) Okay.

917
00:48:27,405 --> 00:48:28,870
(Yeongwoo) Then it'll...

918
00:48:29,874 --> 00:48:31,842
look like this. Ta-da.

919
00:48:31,909 --> 00:48:34,281
[gasps]
(Dareum) Looks good.

920
00:48:37,505 --> 00:48:39,205
(D.N.X Concert Outfit Reference Designs)

921
00:48:44,098 --> 00:48:46,098
(Stage outfit-inspired merch)

922
00:48:46,123 --> 00:48:48,729
[taps]
(Dareum) This is the most difficult.

923
00:48:51,747 --> 00:48:53,564
[phone vibrating]

924
00:48:55,032 --> 00:48:56,003
[rattles]

925
00:48:56,527 --> 00:48:57,757
(Manager Na Wonbin)

926
00:48:57,781 --> 00:48:58,733
[music stops]

927
00:48:58,800 --> 00:48:59,937
Yes, Mr. Na.

928
00:49:02,545 --> 00:49:03,474
(Dareum) What?

929
00:49:04,278 --> 00:49:05,176
[Wonbin sighs]

930
00:49:05,576 --> 00:49:06,534
(Wonbin) Someone...

931
00:49:07,025 --> 00:49:09,597
posted a threat to attack the venue.

932
00:49:09,664 --> 00:49:11,682
It's most likely just a prank,

933
00:49:11,749 --> 00:49:14,080
but the police are going
to search the entire venue.

934
00:49:14,721 --> 00:49:15,753
So the booking has been canceled.

935
00:49:16,234 --> 00:49:17,154
[Miyeong sighs]

936
00:49:17,801 --> 00:49:21,027
And the place we found in a hurry is...
[Wonbin sighs]

937
00:49:21,094 --> 00:49:21,934
[tapping keyboard]

938
00:49:22,001 --> 00:49:22,960
This place.

939
00:49:25,629 --> 00:49:26,730
[Mina reacts]

940
00:49:27,759 --> 00:49:28,570
It's pretty small, isn't it?

941
00:49:28,952 --> 00:49:30,772
(Hagi) The stage is really close
to the audience.

942
00:49:30,839 --> 00:49:31,872
[employees grunt]

943
00:49:31,939 --> 00:49:34,472
So it looks like the stage outfits
will be changed too.

944
00:49:35,435 --> 00:49:37,764
Then our outfit-inspired merch...

945
00:49:37,831 --> 00:49:39,000
(Wonbin) Yes. I'm sorry.

946
00:49:39,413 --> 00:49:42,122
Please design them
to match the new outfits.

947
00:49:42,189 --> 00:49:43,300
[employees exclaim]

948
00:49:44,084 --> 00:49:45,385
[sighs]
[calm music]

949
00:49:45,452 --> 00:49:46,450
[faint sigh]

950
00:49:48,155 --> 00:49:49,353
[sighs]

951
00:49:57,567 --> 00:49:58,829
[Dareum inhales]

952
00:50:02,725 --> 00:50:03,934
[sighs]

953
00:50:07,306 --> 00:50:08,372
[sighs]

954
00:50:20,151 --> 00:50:21,979
[music: "My Bias, My Boss" theme song]

955
00:50:23,457 --> 00:50:24,522
[whoosh sound]

956
00:50:26,860 --> 00:50:29,567
(Hagi) Announce the venue change
across all available channels.

957
00:50:29,634 --> 00:50:30,961
[tapping keyboard]

958
00:50:32,785 --> 00:50:34,385
(Showcase venue change announcement)

959
00:50:35,836 --> 00:50:37,134
(Mina) Let me check.

960
00:50:37,504 --> 00:50:39,570
You only need to send
half of the display racks.

961
00:50:39,637 --> 00:50:40,437
[whoosh sound]

962
00:50:40,504 --> 00:50:43,443
(Hagi) It's an invitation-only showcase,
so please set up a registration link.

963
00:50:45,712 --> 00:50:47,533
(D-Angel 1st Fan Club President)
[Miyeong exclaims]
[whoosh sound]

964
00:50:47,548 --> 00:50:49,847
I haven't felt this fired up in ages.
[mouse clicking]

965
00:50:49,914 --> 00:50:51,181
[mouse clicking]
[Miyeong sighs]
[taps keyboard]

966
00:50:51,848 --> 00:50:53,416
(Miyeong) Attention, D-Angels!

967
00:50:53,440 --> 00:50:55,440
This is the real venue
for D.N.X's showcase.

968
00:50:55,656 --> 00:50:58,121
Check the link and hurry!
[tapping sound]

969
00:50:58,188 --> 00:50:58,938
[tapping keyboard]

970
00:51:00,100 --> 00:51:00,990
[mouse clicking]

971
00:51:01,014 --> 00:51:01,714
(Your post has been uploaded)

972
00:51:03,038 --> 00:51:04,695
[exclaims]
[bubble popping sounds]

973
00:51:04,762 --> 00:51:05,496
[whoosh sound]

974
00:51:05,563 --> 00:51:07,714
[bubble popping sounds]
[ding sounds]

975
00:51:14,107 --> 00:51:15,856
[fans murmur]

976
00:51:18,846 --> 00:51:20,110
[whoosh sound]

977
00:51:21,011 --> 00:51:22,226
[whoosh sound]

978
00:51:24,081 --> 00:51:24,918
[whoosh sound]

979
00:51:26,854 --> 00:51:27,785
[whoosh sound]

980
00:51:31,567 --> 00:51:33,593
(Miyeong) Hello. Take one of these.

981
00:51:33,660 --> 00:51:35,192
Have fun.

982
00:51:36,176 --> 00:51:37,647
Hello. Take one of these.

983
00:51:37,714 --> 00:51:39,000
- Have fun!
- (Wontae) Wow.

984
00:51:39,067 --> 00:51:40,880
- (Mina) It's this, right?
- (Wontae) Did you make that yourself?

985
00:51:40,947 --> 00:51:42,135
(fan 1) Yes...
[Mina, Wontae exclaim and clap]

986
00:51:42,202 --> 00:51:43,637
- (Chaeeun) Enjoy the showcase.
- (Yeongwoo) Thank you.

987
00:51:43,704 --> 00:51:46,206
(fans) Our president!
[Miyeong gasps]

988
00:51:46,273 --> 00:51:47,407
(fan 2) It's been such a long time.

989
00:51:47,474 --> 00:51:49,333
- (fan 3) We came after seeing your post.
- (Miyeong) Really?

990
00:51:49,400 --> 00:51:50,635
- You saw it?
- (fans) Yes!

991
00:51:50,702 --> 00:51:52,543
- (Miyeong) Wow!
- (Yeongwoo) Wow.

992
00:51:52,610 --> 00:51:53,577
- (Miyeong) Here, take this.
- (fan 2) Thank you.

993
00:51:53,644 --> 00:51:54,781
(fan 3) We'll cheer as loud as we can.
[music stops]

994
00:51:54,848 --> 00:51:56,555
[murmuring]

995
00:51:57,890 --> 00:51:58,968
[Lee Chan clears throat]

996
00:52:00,981 --> 00:52:01,952
(Wonbin) Everyone.

997
00:52:02,456 --> 00:52:04,620
You have to wear the APPELLO merch now.

998
00:52:05,286 --> 00:52:06,290
[Wonbin laughs]

999
00:52:07,261 --> 00:52:09,158
- (Dareum) Hello.
- (members) Hello.

1000
00:52:09,225 --> 00:52:11,453
(Dareum) Let's do this.
[members clap]

1001
00:52:17,863 --> 00:52:18,905
Ta-da!

1002
00:52:18,972 --> 00:52:20,704
(members) Wow.
[Dareum laughs]

1003
00:52:20,771 --> 00:52:22,609
[calm music]
[members, Wonbin exclaim]

1004
00:52:25,412 --> 00:52:27,234
[members exclaim]
[Dareum laughs]

1005
00:52:28,145 --> 00:52:30,113
(Roy) It's pretty.
It's like a shooting star.

1006
00:52:30,180 --> 00:52:30,984
This is...

1007
00:52:31,518 --> 00:52:32,516
(Dareum) Yeah.

1008
00:52:33,253 --> 00:52:35,071
The venue's a bit smaller,

1009
00:52:35,138 --> 00:52:37,167
but the fans would be happy
to see you up close.

1010
00:52:37,624 --> 00:52:39,189
[clinks]
So...

1011
00:52:39,923 --> 00:52:41,361
I just gave it a small detail.

1012
00:52:43,011 --> 00:52:44,962
The closest star.

1013
00:52:50,838 --> 00:52:52,133
[rattles]

1014
00:52:57,879 --> 00:52:58,834
Thank you...

1015
00:52:59,610 --> 00:53:00,948
for returning it to me like this.

1016
00:53:01,652 --> 00:53:02,746
[faint laugh]

1017
00:53:05,149 --> 00:53:07,554
You should shine onstage again.

1018
00:53:10,320 --> 00:53:12,801
[Wonbin exclaims and claps]
(Wonbin) Awesome.

1019
00:53:16,767 --> 00:53:17,995
[Lee Chan sighs]

1020
00:53:23,070 --> 00:53:24,204
Are you ready?

1021
00:53:25,272 --> 00:53:26,467
[sighs]

1022
00:53:27,435 --> 00:53:28,334
What about our fans?

1023
00:53:28,976 --> 00:53:29,973
(Lee Chan) Did a lot of them come?

1024
00:53:31,901 --> 00:53:32,980
Go and see for yourself.
[music stops]

1025
00:53:35,050 --> 00:53:37,514
[commotion]
(Mimi) I can't believe
we're actually here!

1026
00:53:37,581 --> 00:53:39,373
And we're watching at the front!

1027
00:53:39,440 --> 00:53:41,074
(Seula) My heart's about to explode...

1028
00:53:41,141 --> 00:53:42,553
Roy will do a good job, right?

1029
00:53:46,402 --> 00:53:47,400
I...

1030
00:53:48,263 --> 00:53:49,563
believe in Roy...

1031
00:53:49,630 --> 00:53:50,694
the performance genius!

1032
00:53:51,648 --> 00:53:52,563
I know he can do it.

1033
00:53:53,333 --> 00:53:54,932
[playful music]

1034
00:53:55,544 --> 00:53:56,834
(Minwoo) Who's your bias, Mimi?

1035
00:53:56,901 --> 00:54:00,281
(Mimi) Well, Chan got me into the fandom,

1036
00:54:00,348 --> 00:54:02,706
but I was crazy about Hyeok for a while.

1037
00:54:03,844 --> 00:54:04,842
What about now?

1038
00:54:05,637 --> 00:54:06,543
Minwoo.

1039
00:54:06,610 --> 00:54:08,266
[whistling sound]
[laughs]

1040
00:54:08,333 --> 00:54:10,133
All right, then.

1041
00:54:10,687 --> 00:54:12,349
[Minwoo laughs]
(Seula) Hey!

1042
00:54:12,836 --> 00:54:13,990
[whoosh sound]

1043
00:54:14,057 --> 00:54:15,968
[cat hissing sound]
Go be lovey-dovey at home, darn it.

1044
00:54:17,024 --> 00:54:17,968
Today's the day...

1045
00:54:19,279 --> 00:54:21,358
that my bias returns to the stage.

1046
00:54:22,167 --> 00:54:23,360
It's a historic day.

1047
00:54:23,427 --> 00:54:24,431
[Seula laughs]

1048
00:54:24,498 --> 00:54:25,462
[Minwoo grunts]

1049
00:54:25,896 --> 00:54:27,931
(Minwoo) Let's go.
[Minwoo laughs]
[music stops]

1050
00:54:31,332 --> 00:54:33,137
[Hyeok sighs and claps]
(Hyeok) All right.

1051
00:54:33,941 --> 00:54:35,472
Our fans have waited for nine years.

1052
00:54:35,930 --> 00:54:37,248
Let's give it everything we've got.

1053
00:54:37,315 --> 00:54:39,009
[members react]
[uplifting music]

1054
00:54:41,678 --> 00:54:43,013
- (Hyeok) One.
- (Lee Chan) Two.

1055
00:54:43,432 --> 00:54:44,914
- (Jinu) Three.
- (Taeo) Four.

1056
00:54:44,981 --> 00:54:46,553
Five. Let's do this!

1057
00:54:46,620 --> 00:54:48,285
(members) Let's do this!

1058
00:54:49,234 --> 00:54:50,605
[whoosh sound]
[music stops]

1059
00:54:50,672 --> 00:54:52,579
[fans murmur]

1060
00:55:15,047 --> 00:55:16,968
(Minwoo) One, two, three.

1061
00:55:19,693 --> 00:55:21,451
[Dareum gasps]
[fans cheer]

1062
00:55:26,557 --> 00:55:28,873
[D.N.X's "Neverland" plays]
[fans cheer]

1063
00:55:31,896 --> 00:55:32,930
[Dareum exclaims]

1064
00:55:33,440 --> 00:55:34,611
[Dareum cheers]

1065
00:55:36,716 --> 00:55:38,705
[D.N.X's "New Shirt" plays]

1066
00:55:38,772 --> 00:55:40,620
[fans cheer]

1067
00:55:47,827 --> 00:55:49,719
[D.N.X's "Dear My Light" plays]

1068
00:55:49,786 --> 00:55:51,562
[fans cheer]

1069
00:55:58,394 --> 00:55:59,891
[music stops]

1070
00:56:01,586 --> 00:56:03,383
[lights click]
[fans cheer]

1071
00:56:09,803 --> 00:56:11,729
[lights click]
[fans cheer]

1072
00:56:14,137 --> 00:56:16,209
Hyeok!
[Minwoo cheers]

1073
00:56:16,276 --> 00:56:17,867
(Mimi) Hyeok!

1074
00:56:17,934 --> 00:56:18,994
(Minwoo) You're so cool!

1075
00:56:19,061 --> 00:56:21,182
[lights click]
[fans cheer louder]

1076
00:56:22,502 --> 00:56:25,482
[Dareum cheers]
(fans) D.N.X!

1077
00:56:25,549 --> 00:56:28,337
D.N.X!

1078
00:56:28,404 --> 00:56:30,320
[fans chant "D.N.X"]

1079
00:56:31,855 --> 00:56:33,285
[wistful music]

1080
00:56:39,062 --> 00:56:41,414
[fans chant "D.N.X"]

1081
00:56:44,933 --> 00:56:46,033
[Lee Chan grunts]

1082
00:56:46,592 --> 00:56:49,673
(Lee Chan) We put a lot of thought
into what our first song should be.

1083
00:56:50,309 --> 00:56:51,308
Firstly...

1084
00:56:51,812 --> 00:56:55,012
thank you so much
for waiting all these years.

1085
00:56:55,482 --> 00:56:57,428
[fans cheer]

1086
00:56:58,552 --> 00:57:00,303
[Dareum cheers]

1087
00:57:03,208 --> 00:57:04,288
This song...

1088
00:57:10,600 --> 00:57:12,062
is for all of you,

1089
00:57:12,672 --> 00:57:14,698
who helped us come together

1090
00:57:16,356 --> 00:57:18,155
and perform onstage again.

1091
00:57:18,222 --> 00:57:20,109
[fans cheer]
[music stops]

1092
00:57:22,792 --> 00:57:23,807
The title...

1093
00:57:26,687 --> 00:57:28,979
is "YOU."
[shining sound on screen]
[fans cheer]

1094
00:57:35,752 --> 00:57:37,615
[fan song "YOU" intro plays]

1095
00:57:45,732 --> 00:57:50,137
<i>Perhaps everything that shines</i>

1096
00:57:50,204 --> 00:57:54,343
(Lee Chan) <i>Will fade away someday</i>

1097
00:57:54,410 --> 00:57:58,766
<i>Dreaming used to be a part of who I am</i>
[fans cheer]

1098
00:57:58,833 --> 00:58:03,236
<i>But now, I'm just getting through each day</i>

1099
00:58:03,303 --> 00:58:07,621
(Roy) <i>The gazes on me</i>

1100
00:58:07,688 --> 00:58:12,033
<i>Waiting for the cheers</i>

1101
00:58:12,100 --> 00:58:16,726
<i>It makes me uneasy
Like walking on thin ice</i>

1102
00:58:16,793 --> 00:58:20,397
- <i>Close my eyes, fall asleep</i>
- (Dareum) You're so cool!

1103
00:58:20,464 --> 00:58:24,934
<i>Sometimes everything comes crashing down</i>

1104
00:58:26,136 --> 00:58:29,200
<i>But I'm here now</i>

1105
00:58:30,200 --> 00:58:33,910
(Lee Chan) <i>Only you, only you</i>

1106
00:58:33,977 --> 00:58:37,995
<i>Make me exist</i>
[fans cheer]

1107
00:58:38,995 --> 00:58:42,789
<i>When the world shakes me</i>

1108
00:58:42,856 --> 00:58:47,250
<i>And I lose myself</i>

1109
00:58:48,262 --> 00:58:52,918
- (Hyeok) <i>In every moment and every place</i>
- (Mimi) Hyeok!

1110
00:58:52,985 --> 00:58:57,134
(Hyeok) <i>We'll dream together again</i>

1111
00:58:58,952 --> 00:59:03,206
(Lee Chan) <i>Only you</i>

1112
00:59:03,273 --> 00:59:05,668
<i>Make me exist</i>
[fans cheer]

1113
00:59:05,735 --> 00:59:07,695
[members sing "YOU"]

1114
00:59:11,839 --> 00:59:13,316
[fans cheer]

1115
00:59:13,340 --> 00:59:14,940
(Five stars shining again
D-Angel will be with you forever)

1116
00:59:23,564 --> 00:59:25,234
[members continue singing "YOU"]

1117
00:59:27,941 --> 00:59:29,670
[fans cheer]

1118
00:59:31,467 --> 00:59:33,470
(Seula) Roy!

1119
00:59:35,209 --> 00:59:36,740
[fans cheer]

1120
00:59:37,718 --> 00:59:41,077
(Dareum) I once used to follow
a shining star.

1121
00:59:41,144 --> 00:59:43,413
[D.N.X cheers on screen]
[friends cheer]

1122
00:59:46,437 --> 00:59:48,667
But that star wasn't the only light

1123
00:59:49,523 --> 00:59:50,954
that guided my way.

1124
00:59:51,721 --> 00:59:53,234
[Dareum laughs]

1125
00:59:53,907 --> 00:59:55,892
There was another light

1126
00:59:56,734 --> 00:59:59,658
shining next to me
whenever I felt I was alone.

1127
00:59:59,725 --> 01:00:04,000
(Dareum) I think...
I have feelings for you.

1128
01:00:07,554 --> 01:00:09,473
(Hagi) From now on, whatever happens,

1129
01:00:10,697 --> 01:00:11,808
don't let go of my hand.

1130
01:00:16,040 --> 01:00:17,067
(Dareum) Now...

1131
01:00:17,818 --> 01:00:18,915
I know...

1132
01:00:21,846 --> 01:00:23,787
that stars aren't that far away.

1133
01:00:26,153 --> 01:00:27,691
All these lights...

1134
01:00:28,764 --> 01:00:33,096
are stars,
each shining in their own place.

1135
01:00:35,016 --> 01:00:38,805
(Lee Chan) <i>Only you, only you</i>

1136
01:00:38,872 --> 01:00:42,672
<i>Make me exist</i>
[fans cheer]

1137
01:00:43,779 --> 01:00:46,000
<i>When the world</i>

1138
01:00:46,067 --> 01:00:51,434
<i>Shakes me and I lose myself</i>

1139
01:00:53,067 --> 01:00:57,724
(Taeo) <i>In every moment and every place</i>

1140
01:00:57,791 --> 01:01:02,174
<i>We'll dream together again</i>

1141
01:01:03,857 --> 01:01:07,989
<i>Only you</i>

1142
01:01:08,056 --> 01:01:09,874
<i>Make me exist</i>

1143
01:01:09,941 --> 01:01:12,434
[fans cheer]
[members sing "YOU"]

1144
01:01:28,295 --> 01:01:30,467
(Dareum) And that when I became
a light for someone else,

1145
01:01:34,341 --> 01:01:35,392
I was also...

1146
01:01:36,663 --> 01:01:38,028
shining brightly.

1147
01:01:42,834 --> 01:01:44,781
[whoosh sound]
[music stops]

1148
01:01:47,663 --> 01:01:49,068
[birds singing]

1149
01:01:49,382 --> 01:01:50,941
[lively music]

1150
01:01:56,601 --> 01:01:58,248
[children shouting]

1151
01:02:02,882 --> 01:02:04,659
(Dareum) Bubbles.

1152
01:02:04,726 --> 01:02:05,689
[Dareum exclaims]

1153
01:02:06,367 --> 01:02:07,357
How pretty.

1154
01:02:11,706 --> 01:02:12,662
Dareum.

1155
01:02:15,235 --> 01:02:16,534
[Dareum gasps and exclaims]

1156
01:02:17,398 --> 01:02:18,501
(Dareum) This is so cute.

1157
01:02:22,176 --> 01:02:23,319
You like it?

1158
01:02:23,386 --> 01:02:24,596
(Dareum) Yeah!

1159
01:02:24,995 --> 01:02:28,033
I want a ring too, as a matching set.

1160
01:02:28,541 --> 01:02:29,546
[faint laugh]

1161
01:02:30,797 --> 01:02:31,815
No.

1162
01:02:32,344 --> 01:02:33,250
(Dareum) What?

1163
01:02:33,580 --> 01:02:34,718
It'll wither soon.

1164
01:02:35,602 --> 01:02:37,491
It's all for the fun of it.

1165
01:02:37,558 --> 01:02:38,982
(Dareum) I want a ring too.

1166
01:02:39,049 --> 01:02:40,156
With a big flower.

1167
01:02:40,834 --> 01:02:42,459
Where can we find some?

1168
01:02:43,961 --> 01:02:46,234
(Hagi) I want to give you this instead.

1169
01:02:57,329 --> 01:02:58,275
I...

1170
01:02:59,470 --> 01:03:00,510
want to be a place

1171
01:03:01,691 --> 01:03:03,380
for you to return to every day.

1172
01:03:06,588 --> 01:03:07,551
Will you...

1173
01:03:12,106 --> 01:03:13,056
stay by my side?

1174
01:03:20,834 --> 01:03:22,152
[sighs]

1175
01:03:24,927 --> 01:03:25,902
(Dareum) Yes.

1176
01:03:26,400 --> 01:03:27,384
[music stops]

1177
01:03:29,663 --> 01:03:30,674
[laughs]

1178
01:03:32,613 --> 01:03:33,576
I will.

1179
01:03:34,481 --> 01:03:35,579
Every day.

1180
01:03:37,317 --> 01:03:39,080
[music: "My Bias, My Boss" theme song]

1181
01:03:39,791 --> 01:03:40,717
(Hagi) Right!

